+
+## Rollback
+
+Keep `ModLoader.csa` (v1) untouched. To rollback from vNext:
+
+```bash
+cp ModLoader.csa.bak ModLoader.csa   # if you used --backup
+# or just set Static[150]=0 in save: pStatic1[150]=0
+```
