+
+## Static2 Bitsets
+Static2 is less bit-mapped, more *arrays* (`gArray_OutfitCache_R` 398-399 etc.). No `SET_BIT` on Static2 observed — all `StaticSet2 397 = 84` style are direct stores, not flagwords.
